# Production native Canvas folds, run on a new isolated profile.
settle 35
key escape
open mere://fold-alpha
settle 10
open mere://fold-beta
settle 10
open mere://fold-gamma
settle 10
open mere://fold-delta
settle 90
assert physics running
act Pause or resume physics
settle 6
assert physics paused
key escape
act Fit to view
select-graph-member none
act Save session
settle 5
record-graph-folds 01_source 0
capture 01_source
select-graph-member mere://fold-alpha
select-graph-member mere://fold-beta
act Fold selection
settle 6
record-graph-folds 02_one_fold 1
capture 02_one_fold
act Undo fold
settle 5
record-graph-folds 03_undone 0
capture 03_undone
act Redo fold
settle 5
record-graph-folds 04_redone 1
select-graph-member mere://fold-gamma
select-graph-member mere://fold-delta
act Fold selection
settle 6
record-graph-folds 05_two_folds 2
capture 05_two_folds
# Badge input uses the same native press/release handlers as a normal click.
activate-graph-fold 0
settle 5
record-graph-folds 06_badge_expanded 1
capture 06_badge_expanded
act Undo fold
settle 5
record-graph-folds 07_saved 2
capture 07_saved
log Native graph folds saved for a fresh process
